<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.27 pct, 3-mo 23.24 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.27 pct, 3-mo 23.24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) rate remained unchanged for both the one-month and the three-month termin, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The BUBOR was fixed by the NBH at 23.27 percent for one month and at 23.24 percent for three months.</p>
<p>The NBH began calculating BUBOR on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
